#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.desktop.in.in:3
#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Work better with regular breaks"
msgstr "定时休息，高效工作"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons! The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.desktop.in.in:11
msgid "pomodoro;timer;productivity;time tracker;time management;"
msgstr "番茄钟;计时器;效率;时间记录;时间管理;pomodoro;timer;"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"A productivity timer that helps you work more effectively by alternating "
"focused work sessions with short breaks. By default, work for 25 minutes, "
"then take a 5-minute break to stay focused and prevent burnout."
msgstr "通过交替安排专注工作和短暂休息，帮助您提高效率。默认专注 25 分钟后休息 5 分钟，让您保持专注，避免过度疲劳。"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Key features:"
msgstr "主要功能："

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Customizable work session and break lengths"
msgstr "可自定义专注与休息时长"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Screen overlay during breaks"
msgstr "休息时显示全屏提醒"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "System tray icon"
msgstr "系统托盘图标"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Hotkeys (global shortcuts)"
msgstr "全局快捷键"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Daily, weekly, and monthly statistics"
msgstr "每日、每周和每月统计"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Extensible via custom shell commands, D-Bus, and CLI"
msgstr "可通过自定义 Shell 命令、D-Bus 和命令行扩展功能"

#: data/io.github.focustimerhq.FocusTimer.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid "GNOME Shell extension for deeper desktop integration"
msgstr "通过 GNOME Shell 扩展与桌面进一步集成"

